/T (This project analyzes a Pizza Sales dataset using SQL to answer business-related questions.  The dataset contains orders, pizzas, pizza types, and order details. The goal was to practice SQL joins, aggregations, window functions, and subqueries while uncovering useful business insights such as revenue, top-selling pizzas, and order trends.)
